# D2904 (a write's recheck beside SubPlan steps and a pending InitPlan): the IR copies an InitPlan's value only where every row reaching the write has forced it, else the runner's recheck forces it as EvalPlanQualStart does (an UPDATE and a DELETE beside an InitPlan read only in an untaken CASE arm: division by zero at the recheck, a VOLATILE one called there, two in one CASE, the runner's own form, one read unconditionally)
test: write-d2904-pending-initplan
